  \(dq\-\-isolation_mode IIFE\(dq
  \(dq\-\-assume_function_wrapper\(dq
  \(dq\-\-emit_use_strict\(dq
  \(dq\-\-jscomp_off=undefinedVars\(dq
]
.EE
.PP
\f[I]Example:\f[R]
.IP
.EX
[
  \(dq\-\-formatting PRETTY_PRINT\(dq
]
.EE
