/modules/cross/ghcjs
.UE \c
.SS compiler
The GHC to build with:
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]name\f[R] selects one of the driver\(cqs own compilers
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]package\f[R] supplies one from outside them, and the sibling
fields are the attributes the drivers read off a compiler
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]platforms\f[R] gives cross targets their own compiler and
toolchain
.PP
A platform without an entry uses the fields above it.
.PP
Describe such a compiler once.
The modules under \f[CR]nix\-haskell\-compilers\f[R] are ready\-made
entries for compilers distributed outside the drivers\(cq package sets.
.PP
\f[I]Type:\f[R] submodule
.PP
\f[I]Default:\f[R]
.IP
.EX
{ }
.EE
.PP
\f[I]Example:\f[R]
.IP
.EX
{
  name = \(dqghc912\(dq;

  \f[I]# a bindist for the wasm target, with the toolchain it was built\f[R]
  \f[I]# with, as \(ganix\-haskell\-compilers/ghc\-wasm\-meta\(ga supplies it\f[R]
  platforms.wasi32 = {
    package = wasm\-ghc;
    version = \(dq9.12.4.20260731\(dq;
    targetPrefix = \(dqwasm32\-wasi\-\(dq;
    enableShared = true;
    haskell\-nix.libDir = \(dqlib\(dq;
    haskell\-nix.extraNonReinstallablePkgs = [ \(dqsystem\-cxx\-std\-lib\(dq ];
    nixpkgs.enableExternalInterpreter = false;
    toolchain = {
      package = wasi\-sdk;
      cc = \(dqwasm32\-wasi\-clang\(dq;
      ar = \(dqllvm\-ar\(dq;
      ld = \(dqwasm\-ld\(dq;
      strip = \(dqllvm\-strip\(dq;
    };
  };
}
.EE
.PP
\f[I]Declared by:\f[R] \- \c
.UR file://%3Cnix-haskell%3E/modules/common
/modules/common
.UE \c
.SS compiler.enableShared
Whether the compiler can build shared libraries.
Each driver reads it:
.IP \(bu 2
haskell.nix sets every component\(cqs \f[CR]shared:\f[R] flag from it
.IP \(bu 2
nixpkgs builds a cross package set non\-static, with shared libraries
instead of static ones
.PP
GHC\(cqs wasm backend needs it, because its Template Haskell interpreter
loads shared objects.
.PP
\f[I]Type:\f[R] null or boolean
.PP
\f[I]Default:\f[R] \f[CR]null\f[R]: the \f[CR]enableShared\f[R] of
\f[CR]package\f[R], else \f[CR]true\f[R]
.PP
\f[I]Declared by:\f[R] \- \c
.UR file://%3Cnix-haskell%3E/modules/common
/modules/common
.UE \c
.SS compiler.package
A compiler used directly instead of one from the driver\(cqs package
sets:
.IP \(bu 2
a bindist
.IP \(bu 2
an out\-of\-tree cross compiler
.IP \(bu 2
a locally built GHC
.PP
