.SS platforms.<name>.packages.<name>.wasm\-opt.extraFlags
Flags appended after \f[CR]\-all \-O<level>\f[R], so one of these
overrides what the level sets.
Write one flag per element, with its value in the same string.
The elements are joined into one command line.
.PP
The default flags set the optimize level of \f[CR]\-O2\f[R] at the
shrink level of \f[CR]\-O1\f[R], drop the memory a module never reads,
discard debug information, and repeat the passes until they find nothing
more.
